F dec / F pass = the FPGA arm's decode and PCIe-pass phases (OASIS_IQR_TIMING). decode is
host work and SHOULD scale; passes is FPGA work and should NOT. cpu-s = process CPU-seconds
(.timer user), so `offload` is how much host CPU the FPGA path gives back at equal cores.

